<h2 id="prizes" tabindex="-1">Prizes<a class="anchor" href="#prizes" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>
<h3 id="first" tabindex="-1">First<a class="anchor" href="#first" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>
<p>Solving any challenge first gives you a prize of $30 USD or a comparable equivalent.
It also includes the Finisher's prize.</p>
<h3 id="finisher" tabindex="-1">Finisher<a class="anchor" href="#finisher" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>
<p>Solving any challenge gives you a shout out in the post, Twitter and other media. Your name
will be documented in Omnigres documentation where we'll record this contest for posterity.</p>
<h3 id="surprise" tabindex="-1">Surprise<a class="anchor" href="#surprise" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h3>
<p>You built something not listed in the above challenges and it is awesome? There are three $50 prizes for this,
one for each entry! Includes the Finisher's prize.</p>
